# Document Model

## Node types

`frame` | `group` | `sprite` | `rect` | `text` (text optional until P1+)

Every node: `id`, `name`, `type`, `visible`, `locked`, `transform` (`x,y,w,h,rotation,opacity`), optional `children`.

## Commands

Implement edits as commands with `execute` / `undo` (or reverse patch). History stack lives in document package or editor store wrapping it.

## Serialization

- Versioned JSON: `{ schemaVersion, document }`
- Assets referenced by id; binary/dataURL stored in asset library section
- AI export must be stable field names (snake or camel — pick camelCase and keep consistent)
